{"reference":"Jeremiah 10","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":10,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Within Jeremiah","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Jeremiah 10 stands within the book’s broad chapters 2–25 section in one practical outline. The book as received brings together varied forms of material—including poetry, prose sermons, narratives, letters, and collections—though its compositional history remains disputed. This wider variety cautions against expecting every chapter to follow one uniform literary pattern.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_010_968eac4b7179fc49b0e335a1"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}